</rp></ruby>でした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他们当时是学童。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">しょうがない</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">没有（其他）办法；无可奈何；无可奈何；无能为力；不可避免；别无选择；无计可施；无用；毫无意义；徒劳无益；不管用；不够；不足；无可救药（的人）；令人烦恼；麻烦；糟糕透顶；难以忍受；无法容忍；忍不住；迫不及待</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"127249\"><ruby>男<rp>(</rp><rt>おとこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のいたずらはしょうがない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">男孩会是男孩。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">消極的</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しょうきょくてき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">消极的；被动的；不积极的；敷衍的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"76208\"><ruby>警察<rp>(</rp><rt>けいさつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>医療<rp>(</rp><rt>いりょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>事故<rp>(</rp><rt>じこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>立件<rp>(</rp><rt>りっけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>消極的<rp>(</rp><rt>しょうきょくてき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">警察不愿意对医疗案件提出刑事指控。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">賞金</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しょうきん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">奖金；奖励金；赏金</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"180573\"><ruby>協力者<rp>(